  "captions": [
    {"start": 0.481, "end": 6.241, "lines": ["Given by mission in the 1870s,","and then by 1878,"]},
    {"start": 6.241, "end": 9.761, "lines": ["the name of the agency is changed","from the U.S. Coast Survey"]},
    {"start": 9.761, "end": 15.681, "lines": ["to the U.S. Coast and Geodetic Survey","to recognize that important mission area."]},
    {"start": 15.681, "end": 20.001, "lines": ["And this is really amazing work","when you think about it."]},
    {"start": 20.001, "end": 22.801, "lines": ["What was the first","charting project that Hassler,"]},
    {"start": 22.801, "end": 26.321, "lines": ["as the first superintendent","of Coast Survey, worked on?"]},
    {"start": 26.321, "end": 28.201, "lines": ["Hassler, the first."]},
    {"start": 28.576, "end": 31.136, "lines": ["work he did was all","around New York Harbor."]},
    {"start": 31.136, "end": 34.416, "lines": ["If you look at you know,","we know Manhattan's an island, right?"]},
    {"start": 34.416, "end": 38.016, "lines": ["We have that that vision","in our minds as Americans."]},
    {"start": 38.016, "end": 39.616, "lines": ["But what else is around it?"]},
    {"start": 39.616, "end": 42.416, "lines": ["You know, Long Island,","Staten Island, Fire Island,"]},
    {"start": 42.416, "end": 44.936, "lines": ["all of these places, they were raw"]},
    {"start": 45.264, "end": 48.464, "lines": ["Untrammeled wilderness at that point."]},
    {"start": 48.464, "end": 53.824, "lines": ["So Hassler needed a group","of really stout men to lug all"]},
    {"start": 53.824, "end": 57.504, "lines": ["of this scientific","equipment out onto a beach."]},
    {"start": 57.504, "end": 61.184, "lines": ["And he's in a carriage","that he had specially designed"]},
    {"start": 61.184, "end": 62.704, "lines": ["to carry the scientific"]},
    {"start": 62.704, "end": 67.304, "lines": ["equipment around in and then use","as his office out there in the field."]},
    {"start": 67.856, "end": 69.536, "lines": ["Some of his notes are preserved."]},
    {"start": 69.536, "end": 73.456, "lines": ["Here's this guy in the middle","of the wilderness doing calculus."]},
    {"start": 73.456, "end": 77.936, "lines": ["I mean, you know, super","complicated mathematical work, right?"]},
    {"start": 77.936, "end": 82.416, "lines": ["And I'm sure his laborers were just","standing around completely mystified"]},
    {"start": 82.416, "end": 84.256, "lines": ["as to what he was about."]},
    {"start": 84.256, "end": 85.256, "lines": ["But…"]},
    {"start": 85.776, "end": 89.376, "lines": ["his plan was to use triangulation."]},
    {"start": 89.376, "end": 94.656, "lines": ["So you've you as succinctly","and as Accurately as possible,"]},
    {"start": 94.656, "end": 98.416, "lines": ["identify one point, you mark that,","and then you work out from there."]},
